---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Best Online Business for Beginners | ExpositionHub"
  description="A practical breakdown of beginner-friendly online business models and the best first path to evaluate."
>
  <main class="container">
    <article class="page-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Best Picks</p>
      <h1>Best Online Business for Beginners</h1>
      <p class="intro">
        Most beginners get stuck because they see too many online income ideas
        without enough context on how the models actually work.
      </p>

      <p>
        The best beginner path is usually the one that is easiest to understand,
        easiest to explain, and easiest to validate with a real market.
      </p>

      <section>
        <h2>1. Service-based online business</h2>
        <p>
          This model involves finding clients and coordinating fulfillment directly
          or through contractors. It is often easier for beginners to understand
          because it connects to real services and real demand.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. Affiliate publishing</h2>
        <p>
          Affiliate publishing can work well, but usually after you understand buyer
          intent, content creation, and how to pre-sell an offer.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. Digital product sales</h2>
        <p>
          This can become scalable, but usually works better after you understand
          your niche, audience, and conversion path.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="highlight">
        <h2>Our current recommended next step</h2>
        <p>
          If you want to see a beginner-oriented business model explained in a guided
          format, the current featured training is the best next step on this site.
        </p>
        <p class="cta-wrap">
          <a class="cta-button" href="/reviews/passive-income-system-review">
            Read the review first
          </a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .container {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 1.25rem;
  }

  .page-card {
    background: #0f172a;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid #1e293b;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: #94a3b8;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.6rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #f8fafc;
  }

  .intro {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: #cbd5f5;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  h2 {
    color: #e2e8f0;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  p {
    color: #cbd5f5;
  }

  .highlight {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: #020617;
    border: 1px solid #1e293b;
  }

  .cta-wrap {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .cta-button {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.25rem;
    background: #22c55e;
    color: #020617;
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .cta-button:hover {
    background: #16a34a;
  }
</style>
